{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06H2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0002": "$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}_\\Lambda$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8a276b26aae9e314d40580f5e18386f78ba2bceeed72f10a6b4afdc3d30031bb", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:99d432c425e9fe11c4085d797cb673903b5921f20372946cc019918e07df25a6", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we discuss how to go between categories cofibred in\ngroupoids over <MATH_0001> to categories cofibred in\ngroupoids over <MATH_0002> and vice versa.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c225c4b07a9d0e4bceae11932f763755eb987e7868e64ba61aceea44812b6e0c", "unit_id": "tag:06H2:prose-0001"}
